Description: DBCA headless LibreOffice build
 Custom DBCA LibreOffice build intended for headless document conversion,
 UNO and unoserver workloads.
 .
 LibreOffice is installed under /opt/libreoffice so that the DBCA-managed
 build remains isolated from Ubuntu's distribution-managed LibreOffice
 packages.
